  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Mars has an escape speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{e}\"></span> and volume <em>V.</em> The mass of planet X is six times that of Mars and its volume is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{V}{8}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the escape speed of planet X?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{e}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{e}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{12}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{e}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{48}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{e}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
